# 📿 Digital Tasbeeh Counter Engine

A simple **Dart OOP-based Tasbeeh Counter Engine** developed for **Mobile Application Development (CSC303)**.

## ✨ Features

* Class & Encapsulation
* Private properties
* Default & Named Constructors
* Getters
* Counter Increment & Reset
* Completion Status
* Notification Mixin

## 🧠 OOP Concepts

```text
Class          → Tasbeeh
Encapsulation  → _counter, _target, _dhikrName
Constructors   → Default + Named
Getters        → counter, target, dhikrName
Methods        → increment(), reset()
Boolean Getter → isCompleted
Mixin          → NotificationMixin
```

## 📿 Supported Dhikr

| Dhikr         | Target |
| ------------- | -----: |
| SubhanAllah   |     33 |
| Alhamdulillah |     33 |
| Allahu Akbar  |     34 |

## ▶️ Run

```bash
dart run tasbeeh.dart
```


> **Note:** Replace `output.png` with the name of your actual screenshot file.

